OL,3,GNEWSAMobile mast to be moved due to
OL,4,Anesting birds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mobile infrastructure company has
OL,7,Fbeen forced to relocate a key
OL,8,Fcommunications mast due to nesting
OL,9,Fbirds.
OL,11,FMobile Broadband Network Limited
OL,12,F(MBNL), which is jointly owned by EE
OL,13,Fand Three, has been given permission to
OL,14,Fbuild a new 40-metre high mast at
OL,15,FDoxford International Business Park, in
OL,16,FSunderland.
OL,18,FThe firm previously had a radio base
OL,19,Fstation nearby but council documents
OL,20,Fconfirmed the site was "lost from the
OL,21,Fnetwork" due to birds on the feeder
OL,22,Fcables.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
